  "description": "XUFGEO crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C93 H42 Dy5 F27 N6 O33. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.519-4.010 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.95-117.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C93H42Dy5F27N6O33. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
